{"id":"n65528-6-6","stage":1,"title":"걸다 · 挂","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65528-6-6-1","ko":"갑자기 차가 멈춰서 놀랐지?","zh":"车突然停下来了，吓了一跳吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子。","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"차가","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차가","audio":"/audio/c4429920a017c41c1ed5.mp3"}},{"text":"멈춰서","meaning":"停止，止住","explanation":"멈추다：停止，止住；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"멈추다","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46133","senseId":"4","lemma":"멈추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멈춰서","audio":"/audio/24e7daf951ec89f617ee.mp3"}},{"text":"놀랐지?","meaning":"惊吓，吃惊","explanation":"놀라다：惊吓，吃惊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"놀라다","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61607","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀랐지","audio":"/audio/15bd3396453e08bdc95d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"eaee887b30c38d73","term":"멈추다","zh":"停止，止住","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3","entryId":"46133","definition":"终止正在做的事情或动作。","pronunciation":["멈추다"]},{"id":"ca0d0655d175ea6c","term":"놀라다","zh":"惊吓，吃惊","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3","entryId":"61607","definition":"因遭到意外或害怕而在刹那间感到紧张或心跳加速。","pronunciation":["놀ː라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e7c43b4fbbe8d798a6fb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65528-6-6-2","ko":"으이구, 갑자기 브레이크를 걸면 어떡해!","zh":"哎呀，怎么能突然踩刹车啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"으이구,","meaning":"哎呀","explanation":"으이구：哎呀。","readings":[{"term":"으이구","audio":"/audio/7b13f9e8067db09d750f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:으이구:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"으이구","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"으이구","audio":"/audio/7b13f9e8067db09d750f.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子。","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"브레이크를","meaning":"制动器，刹车","explanation":"브레이크：制动器，刹车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"브레이크","audio":"/audio/d0d3a184998c0a9862ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61051","senseId":"1","lemma":"브레이크","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"브레이크를","audio":"/audio/efdcf5d88587ac8112cd.mp3"}},{"text":"걸면","meaning":"挂，踩","explanation":"걸다：挂，踩；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"걸다","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65528","senseId":"6","lemma":"걸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸면","audio":"/audio/a04b208ebe26845faeb3.mp3"}},{"text":"어떡해!","meaning":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어떡하다：“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떡하다","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70480","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떡해","audio":"/audio/e5936c89bea41ff1ce92.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7b13f9e8067db09d","term":"으이구","zh":"哎呀","audio":"/audio/7b13f9e8067db09d750f.mp3","definition":"带着不满、责怪或无奈的感叹。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"d0d3a184998c0a98","term":"브레이크","zh":"制动器，刹车","audio":"/audio/d0d3a184998c0a9862ab.mp3","entryId":"61051","definition":"使车俩或机械装置的运行停止或减速的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a44925f8d8720a55","term":"걸다","zh":"挂，踩","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3","entryId":"65528","definition":"使汽车、机器、装置等运行起来。","pronunciation":["걸ː다"]},{"id":"e39300a264725a21","term":"어떡하다","zh":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3","entryId":"70480","definition":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/cefc3a091eada3214127.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.453,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65528","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"6","sourceLevel":"초급","day":41,"sequenceScore":1.8118,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哎呀，怎么能突然踩刹车啊！","车突然停下来了，吓了一跳吧？","因为队伍排不齐，智秀你往左边挪两步吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["车突然停下来了，吓了一跳吧？","因为队伍排不齐，智秀你往左边挪两步吧。","哎呀，怎么能突然踩刹车啊！"],"answer":2}]}
